{"obsah":"<p>This weekend was full not only of exhibitions but also of camps. On Saturday women and girls developed their skills. Sunday was devoted to men.</p>\n\n<p>The weather was probably more pleasant for the ladies. It didn't rain, but let's be honest – it was cold. A really wide range of female bikers came together, but each found her own thing. Basic technique, balance, the pump track and berms were just the start. Gradually the women also took on smaller drops, steps and benches.</p>\n\n<p>From the men, riding in occasional rain (fortunately it only rained for about an hour of net time), we expected a bit of respect. In the park it was a bit of a struggle, but in the forest they showed they weren't afraid to step out of their own shadow. They handled drops into gullies, a double and a few rooty descents with confidence.</p>\n\n<p>We hope everyone moved forward a bit and found out what to work on and practise. During the camps there was already talk of buying new bikes, changing pedals and buying protectors. Thanks also to everyone for the positive feedback on the spot – we'll look forward to any further camps or individual coaching. </p>\n\n<p>A few photos from Katarína below; the rest, including videos, we're sending directly to the participants.</p>\n\n<p>Besides the camps, our team riders were also busy at exhibitions in Svojetice and Lomnice nad Lužnicí – an ideally filled weekend for most of our riders :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_094251368.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_094251368.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209215\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_094352446.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_094352446.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209214\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_104611536.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_104611536.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209212\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_110357842.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_110357842.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209213\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_115418039.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_115418039.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209216\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_130348376.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F20220528_130348376.webp?a